@startuml spresense_main_board_l2b_transport
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK JP"
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

title L2.B: Streaming Engine + Transport Manager 詳細 (white-box)\nL1 「📦 Streaming Engine」 + 「🚚 Transport Manager」 黒箱の合体展開

' ==============================================================
' Streaming Engine (white-box)
' ==============================================================
frame "📦 **Streaming Engine** (white-box)" as STR_BOX #LightYellow {

  component "**Frame Packer**\n責務: 1 フレーム → MJPEG packet\n   header (12B) + JPEG + CRC16\n実装: mjpeg_protocol.c\n      mjpeg_pack_frame()" as C_PACK

  component "**Batch Aggregator**\n責務: 2 frame バッチ化\n   batch header (16B) + meta×N + JPEG×N\n   max ~122 KB\n実装: mjpeg_protocol.c\n      mjpeg_pack_batch()" as C_BATCH

  component "**CRC-16-CCITT Calculator**\n責務: 整合性チェック\n   ビット単位逐次計算\n実装: mjpeg_protocol.c\n      mjpeg_crc16_ccitt()" as C_CRC

  component "**Metrics Packer**\n責務: 58 B metrics packet 生成\n   sync=0xCAFEBEEF\n   13 fields + CRC16\n実装: mjpeg_protocol.c\n      mjpeg_pack_metrics()" as C_METR

  component "**Legacy Protocol Handler**\n責務: H.264 NAL packing\n実装: protocol_handler.c\n⚠ 現行 MJPEG 路では未使用" as C_PROTO #LightGray
}

C_PACK  ..> C_CRC : "CRC 付与"
C_BATCH ..> C_CRC : "CRC 付与"
C_METR  ..> C_CRC : "CRC 付与"

' ==============================================================
' Transport Manager (white-box)
' ==============================================================
frame "🚚 **Transport Manager** (white-box)" as TX_BOX #LightCyan {

  component "**Wi-Fi Lifecycle**\n責務: GS2200M アソシエーション\n   AP connect / DHCP\n実装: wifi_manager.c" as C_WIFI

  component "**TCP Server (BSD socket)**\n責務: listen / accept / send\n   SO_SNDBUF = 256 KB 要求\n実装: tcp_server.c\n      tcp_server_init/send_*" as C_TCP_SRV

  component "**Auto-Reconnect FSM**\n責務: 切断検知 → backoff → 再 accept\n   max=5, backoff 1s + N×2s\n実装: tcp_server.c\n      tcp_server_handle_disconnect/\n      wait_reconnect/send_with_reconnect" as C_RECON

  component "**TCP Health Monitor**\n責務: 送信時間トラッキング\n   moving avg / spike count\n実装: tcp_server.c\n      tcp_health_update()\n      g_tcp_health" as C_HEALTH

  component "**USB Transport**\n責務: USB CDC-ACM bulk send\n   /dev/ttyACM0 経由\n実装: usb_transport.c" as C_USB
}

C_TCP_SRV --> C_HEALTH : "send_time_us 通知"
C_TCP_SRV ..> C_RECON  : "切断検知"
C_RECON   --> C_TCP_SRV : "再 accept 後の fd"
C_WIFI    ..> C_TCP_SRV : "IP 取得後\n   listen 開始"

' ==============================================================
' L2 境界インタフェース (provides / requires)
' ==============================================================
() "frame_pool\n(pop)" as I_FBM_POP
() "batch_packet\n(byte buf)" as I_BATCH
() "transmit_done" as I_TX_DONE
() "metrics_pkt\n(58B)" as I_METR
() "tcp_health_*" as I_HEALTH

' Streaming required (FBM から frame を pull)
C_PACK   ..> I_FBM_POP : "frame_queue_pull"
C_BATCH  ..> I_FBM_POP : "frame_queue_pull ×N"

' Streaming provided
C_PACK   -( I_BATCH
C_BATCH  -( I_BATCH
C_METR   -( I_METR

' Transport required
I_BATCH  )-- C_TCP_SRV
I_BATCH  )-- C_USB
I_METR   )-- C_TCP_SRV

' Transport provided
C_TCP_SRV -( I_TX_DONE
C_USB     -( I_TX_DONE
I_TX_DONE )-- C_PACK : "FBM へ\n   buffer 解放"

C_HEALTH  -( I_HEALTH

' ==============================================================
' 内部バッファ
' ==============================================================
package "Internal Buffers" #LightCoral {
  database "MJPEG batch buf\n~122 KB (heap)" as D_BUF <<datastore>>
  database "metrics_packet\n58 B (stack)" as D_METR <<datastore>>
  database "tcp_health_monitor_t\nmoving_avg + spikes" as D_HEALTH <<datastore>>
  database "tcp_server_t\nfd, port, reconnect_count" as D_TCPS <<datastore>>
}

C_BATCH  --> D_BUF
C_METR   --> D_METR
C_HEALTH --> D_HEALTH
C_TCP_SRV --> D_TCPS

' ==============================================================
' External (NuttX kernel + GS2200M)
' ==============================================================
package "External" #LightGray {
  [BSD socket\n(NET_TCP_NO_STACK=y)] as EXT_SOCK
  [usrsock RPC] as EXT_USRS
  [GS2200M driver task] as EXT_GS
  [USB CDC-ACM driver] as EXT_USBDRV
}

C_TCP_SRV ..> EXT_SOCK : "send/recv"
EXT_SOCK ..> EXT_USRS  : "usrsock IPC"
EXT_USRS ..> EXT_GS    : "SPI 4MHz"

C_USB ..> EXT_USBDRV : "/dev/ttyACM0\n   write()"

' ==============================================================
' 観察ノート
' ==============================================================
note as NOTE_TX #LightYellow
  **🔍 L2.B 観察事項**:

  • **MJPEG_BATCHING_ENABLED = 0 (mjpeg_protocol.h:42)**
    - Batch Aggregator は実装されているが現行 OFF
    - usb_thread_func は単フレーム送信路

  • **Auto-Reconnect (Phase 9)**:
    - exponential backoff (1s + N×2s, max=5)
    - Phase 9 実測: PC FPS 6.74 → 2.77 (再接続中の停止 5-15s が支配)
    - 「再接続が品質を悪化させる」逆相関の発見 (ADR-002 v1.1)

  • **TCP Health Monitor (Phase 9.2)**:
    - 移動平均と spike カウントを metrics packet に同梱
    - GS2200M driver タスクからは「観測対象」のみで書き込まない
      (✅ 修正: 旧プロセスビュー note の「複数スレッド書き込み」誤解を解消)

  • **NET_TCP_NO_STACK=y の意味**:
    - NuttX 自身は TCP スタックを持たず、usrsock 経由で GS2200M に委譲
    - SO_SNDBUF 256 KB 要求 → ベンダーが実際に honor するかは未保証
    - 構造的天井 #1 (tx_buff[1] 直列化) を回避できない

  • **CRC-16-CCITT は逐次計算**:
    - LUT (256 エントリ) はサンプルとして doc 内に存在するが
      実装は逐次 (Phase 7 性能解析時の確認済み事実)
end note

note bottom
  **arc42 階層位置**:
  • 親: spresense_main_board_l1_buildingblocks.puml の 📦+🚚 黒箱
  • 同階層 L2: L2.A (Capture), L2.C (Adaptive Controller)
  • L1 で定義した provides/requires インタフェースを継承
    - frame_pool (required): Frame Buffer Manager から pop
    - batch_packet (provided→required): Streaming → Transport
    - transmit_done (provided): Transport → Frame Buffer Manager
    - metrics_pkt (provided): Health Monitor 経由で Transport へ
end note

@enduml
